      "summary": [
        "Updated buildMaskedCredentials() to accept GitCredentialEntry[] | undefined and return GitCredentialEntry[] with masked tokens.",
        "Added generateUniqueId() helper that auto-generates kebab-case IDs from labels with numeric suffix disambiguation.",
        "Rewrote GET /api/config/credentials to return GitCredentialEntry[] array (was Record<string,string>).",
        "Rewrote PUT /api/config/credentials with new body schema { id?, label, host, token }: auto-generates id from label when omitted, appends -2/-3 suffix on collision, upserts (replaces in-place) when id matches an existing entry, creates new entry otherwise.",
